      "chunk_id": null,
      "contains_speech": true,
      "content": "Hey there! Well, I could use a little help untangling a shopping situation that’s almost as complicated as my work-from-home setup. I placed an order with a mix of home office gear and some hiking stuff—was planning to work remotely from my parents’ place in Seattle and hit the trails. But plot twist: my company just announced we’re heading back to the office soon! \n\nIs there any way I can return just the office items from my order and keep the hiking gear? And if so, how much would I get back? I’d love the refund to go back to my original payment method. If that’s not possible, maybe we can change the shipping address to my NYC place instead. Let me know what you need from me!",
      "cost": 0.0022040000000000002,
      "generation_time_seconds": null,
      "is_audio": false,
